==English==

===Verb===
{{en-verb|head=[[ground]] [[out]]|grounds out|grounding out|grounded out}}

# {{context|electronics|lang=en}} To provide proper [[grounding]] for a circuit.
# {{context|baseball|lang=en}} To become [[out]] by hitting a [[ground ball]] which is fielded and leads to a force or tag of a runner.
#: ''Jones '''grounded out''' to lead off the third.''

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[ground]] [[out]]}}

# {{context|baseball|lang=en}} An instance of grounding out.
#: ''A '''ground out''' was recorded on the scorecard.''

